{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd04 Puzzles with Rotation and Gravity \u2013 A New Experience</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Push boxes, activate switches, and rotate the map to find your way forward.<br>The moment you rotate the stage, the solution changes completely.<br>Conveyor belts, clones, ice, laser blocks, and many other gimmicks constantly challenge and refresh the player\u2019s way of thinking.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And finally, when you solve the puzzle, the satisfying \u201cAha!\u201d moment keeps pushing you forward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745860/extras/72515ea30c2c9fbf171e81bd7e371c84.poster.avif?t=1769077620\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745860/extras/72515ea30c2c9fbf171e81bd7e371c84.webm?t=1769077620\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745860/extras/72515ea30c2c9fbf171e81bd7e371c84.mp4?t=1769077620\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf0c An Adventure Beyond the Black Hole</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dragged into an unexpected black hole, you awaken in an unknown space.<br>There\u2019s only one way home: repair your spaceship and explore mysterious planets in search of clues to escape.<br>Unstable gravity fields, frozen stations, ruins with portals, and electrified areas\u2014<br>you must solve puzzles across diverse environments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But among them lie traces of a hidden civilization\u2026 what could it be?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745860/extras/4ec8539ae4317905ec1499a25599cc97.poster.avif?t=1769077620\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745860/extras/4ec8539ae4317905ec1499a25599cc97.webm?t=1769077620\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745860/extras/4ec8539ae4317905ec1499a25599cc97.mp4?t=1769077620\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfa8 Cute Pixel-Art Characters</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Though lost in a faraway and lonely place, your journey is never alone.<br>With your trusty companion RoVo at your side, even daunting puzzles turn into joyful adventures.<br>The chibi astronaut hero and RoVo\u2019s clumsy but endearing journey,<br>brought to life with colorful pixel art and charming little touches, will warm your heart.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745860/extras/5d7d812ec8fb9f23ccede15d70fbcf23.poster.avif?t=1769077620\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745860/extras/5d7d812ec8fb9f23ccede15d70fbcf23.webm?t=1769077620\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745860/extras/5d7d812ec8fb9f23ccede15d70fbcf23.mp4?t=1769077620\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2728 Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gravity &amp; Rotation Puzzles:</strong> A grid-based puzzle game enhanced with unique mechanics\u2014gravity and map rotation\u2014that demand entirely new ways of thinking.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Easy to Learn, Hard to Master:</strong> Solve every puzzle with just five simple controls\u2014move left/right, rotate the map, and toggle gravity. Yet the depth is limitless!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Variety of Gimmicks &amp; Stages:</strong> Over 200 puzzles filled with boxes, switches, map rotation, gravity shifts, ice, conveyor belts, and more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Adorable Characters &amp; Moments:</strong> Small but heartwarming interactions with your helper RoVo make the journey extra special.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Energy Collection:</strong> Gather energy scattered across each planet to repair your broken spaceship. Will you be able to collect them all?</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3745860?t=1769077620","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745860/9909656da56cb3aaa596cead42597535f5890eb2/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1769077620","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745860/d6d7f476006ded8aef2727fe338e4662dd32fc79/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769077620","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745860/d6d7f476006ded8aef2727fe338e4662dd32fc79/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769077620","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd04 Puzzles with Rotation and Gravity \u2013 A New Experience</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Push boxes, activate switches, and rotate the map to find your way forward.<br>The moment you rotate the stage, the solution changes completely.<br>Conveyor belts, clones, ice, laser blocks, and many other gimmicks constantly challenge and refresh 